  m_Name: PassengerGangway
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  Name: Passenger Gangway
  Text: From the mooring tower a hatch under the nose of the R series airships, connected
    tower and airship by a gangway -flexible bridge and stairs. Passengers would
    have to climb the stairs from ground level to the top of the mooring tower. There
    they would cross onto the Airships with the bridge. The bridge was on wheels
    so that the airships could swing with the wind around the tower as passengers
    boarded.
